OL,3,GNEWSAQueen's joy at 'happy ending to a
OL,4,Aterrible story'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Queen visited a library rebuilt
OL,7,Fafter being destroyed in a riot,
OL,8,Ftelling the children she met that "you
OL,9,Fcan never have too many books".
OL,11,FHer Majesty had donated a box of books
OL,12,Fto Spellow Library in Liverpool after
OL,13,Fit was burned down in widespread unrest
OL,14,Fin the summer of 2024 following the
OL,15,FSouthport attack in which three
OL,16,Fchildren died.
OL,18,FShe was at the library earlier to
OL,19,Funveil a plaque, and brought with her
OL,20,Fmore books to donate.
