OL,3,GNEWSAQueen's joy at 'happy ending to a
OL,4,Aterrible story'
OL,5,
OL,6,FQueen Camilla said seeing the library
OL,7,Frise from the ashes was a "happy
OL,8,Fending" to "such a terrible story".
